 India’s GDP can surprise towards 8%, but corporate earnings remain muted on competition, says Bajaj Alts' Jitendra Gohil
 Bajaj Alts already runs alternative investment funds and holds a SEBI-approved PMS licence. It is preparing to launch a Category III AIF focused on listed equities by the end of this month.
 Khushi Keswani 
